            "platform_specific": {"type": "object",
              "description": "平台差异功能维度评估。",
              "properties": {
                "adaptable": {"type": "boolean", "description": "平台差异功能是否全部可适配（无不可适配点）"},
                "unadaptable": {"type": "array", "items": {"type": "string"}, "description": "平台差异功能中不可适配点的 unadaptable_apis[].id 列表"}}}}},
        "functional_viability": {"type": "string", "enum": ["viable", "viable_with_work", "blocked_external", "unverified"],
          "description": "★派生字段（scripts/report_normalize.py 组装时据 target_assumptions[].target_status 确定性算出、web/server.js serve-time 按 live caps 回投后重算；模型无需填）。与源侧 porting_class/adaptation_assessment 正交的「运行前提是否满足」目标侧总判：viable=前提齐备；viable_with_work=有 partial 前提需处理；blocked_external=有 required 前提在目标不可用（如 shell-out 库依赖的外部二进制），此时代码轴仍可为 no_adaptation（代码无需改，功能受阻于外部前提）；unverified=有 required 前提未核实(unknown)。worst-wins：blocked_external>unverified>viable_with_work>viable。面板/xlsx 与 adaptation_assessment.overall 两轴并列展示。"},
